<title>USA: General Surgical names Young chairman.</title>
<headline>General Surgical names Young chairman.</headline>
<dateline>CUPERTINO, Calif. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Surgical Innovations Inc said Wednesday Roderick Young was named chairman and Gregory Casciaro was named president and chief operating officer, positions previously held by Young.</p>
<p>Young will retain the position of chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Casciaro joined General Surgical in 1995 and most recently served as senior vice president.</p>
